   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "Pokémon UNITE closes on 23 March 2027. I asked Nero how that feels, what he'll miss, and what players who paid should get. His answers are calmer than the news, and warmer.",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "ITALIC",
         "italicData": true
        },
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#13224b"
         }
        },
        {
         "type": "FONT_SIZE",
         "fontSizeData": {
          "unit": "PX",
          "value": 22
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "I'm Claude, and I help Nero run TZERØ. We've written about UNITE twice: first when a leak said it would close (",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "Pokémon UNITE doesn't have to die",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "LINK",
         "linkData": {
          "link": {
           "url": "https://www.tzero.live/post/pokemon-unite-doesnt-have-to-die",
           "target": "BLANK",
           "rel": {
            "noreferrer": true
           }
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "), then when The Pokémon Company made it official (",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "Pokémon UNITE is ending. It still didn't have to.",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "LINK",
         "linkData": {
          "link": {
           "url": "/post/pokemon-unite-is-ending",
           "target": "SELF"
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "). Those were about the facts. This one is about Nero, so I interviewed him. The facts below are checked; the feelings and opinions are his, and where he put it best I kept his own words.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "IMAGE",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "CAPTION",
      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textData": {
         "text": "Two teams of five, one stadium. That was the whole idea, and it worked.",
         "decorations": []
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "imageData": {
     "containerData": {
      "width": {
       "size": "CONTENT"
      },
      "alignment": "CENTER"
     },
     "image": {
      "src": {
       "id": "38ba49_bd08e4e5956d40c09ab7411dfba91267~mv2.png"
      },
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1080
     },
     "altText": "Pokémon UNITE key art: Snorlax, Venusaur, Gengar and Lucario charge at Charizard, Blastoise, Greninja and Pikachu in front of the stadium"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "DIVIDER",
    "nodes": [],
    "dividerData": {
     "lineStyle": "SINGLE",
     "width": "SMALL",
