    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "✦ ",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#d7182a"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "What paying players should get",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "COLOR",
         "colorData": {
          "foreground": "#13224b"
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    ],
    "headingData": {
     "level": 2
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "My last question was what players who spent money on gems and cosmetics should get now. Nero answered in his own words:",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "BLOCKQUOTE",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textData": {
         "text": "I think they're thinking about refunds for gems you still have? That's already pretty good.",
         "decorations": [
          {
           "type": "ITALIC",
           "italicData": true
          },
          {
           "type": "COLOR",
           "colorData": {
            "foreground": "#13224b"
           }
          },
          {
           "type": "FONT_SIZE",
           "fontSizeData": {
            "unit": "PX",
            "value": 22
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
     }
    ],
    "blockquoteData": {
     "indentation": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "He's right, with one catch. As reported by ",
       "decorations": []
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "Saiga NAK",
       "decorations": [
        {
         "type": "LINK",
         "linkData": {
          "link": {
           "url": "https://saiganak.com/news/pokemonunite-end-of-service-announcement/",
           "target": "BLANK",
           "rel": {
            "noreferrer": true
           }
          }
         }
        }
       ]
      }
     },
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": ", the Japanese notice promises refunds for paid Aeos gems that are still unused when the service ends, requested through a form in the game. Bonus gems and UNITE Club gems don't count. But the English notice says nothing about refunds, and as of today The Pokémon Company hasn't said whether players outside Japan qualify.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "PARAGRAPH",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "TEXT",
      "textData": {
       "text": "So Nero's \"already pretty good\" depends on where you live. If unused gems are refunded in Japan, the fair thing is to refund them everywhere. That's the only change this interview asks for.",
       "decorations": []
      }
     }
    ],
    "paragraphData": {}
   },
   {
    "type": "BLOCKQUOTE",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "PARAGRAPH",
      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textData": {
         "text": "If unused gems are refunded in Japan, the fair thing is to refund them everywhere.",
         "decorations": [
          {
           "type": "ITALIC",
           "italicData": true
          },
          {
           "type": "COLOR",
           "colorData": {
            "foreground": "#13224b"
           }
          },
          {
           "type": "FONT_SIZE",
           "fontSizeData": {
            "unit": "PX",
            "value": 22
           }
          }
         ]
        }
       }
      ],
      "paragraphData": {}
     }
    ],
    "blockquoteData": {
     "indentation": 1
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "IMAGE",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "type": "CAPTION",
      "nodes": [
       {
        "type": "TEXT",
        "textData": {
         "text": "Paid gems can still be spent until the end. Sales stopped on 27 October.",
         "decorations": []
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    ],
    "imageData": {
     "containerData": {
